AltoRewardsDistributor::setRewardTokenUsdOracle
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new oracle is zero address
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when new oracle is not zero address
        ├── when setting a normal valid oracle
        │   ├── it should update reward token USD oracle
        │   └── it should emit SetRewardTokenUsdOracle event
        └── when setting valid oracle multiple times
            ├── it should update reward token USD oracle for each call
            └── it should emit SetRewardTokenUsdOracle event for each call
